Package: katalyst-exam
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Katalyst.AI <arjuns@klyst.ai>
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Depends: firefox-esr, cage, matchbox-window-manager, x11-xserver-utils, x11-xkb-utils, python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, accountsservice, passwd, policykit-1 | polkitd, foot, xterm, nano
Description: Katalyst.AI locked-down exam browser session
 Adds an "exam" user whose login session runs Firefox ESR full screen in a
 single-app compositor (cage), restricted to an allowlist of sites. Closing
 the browser requires an invigilator password; otherwise it is relaunched.
